Depends: h96-base (= 8.0.0~r39)
Description: H96 MAX V58 boot chain guards: apt pins, update guards, EDID, hang recovery
 Apt pin protecting boot packages, armbian-update stub and guard path unit,
 update diversion service, initramfs EDID hook and blobs, kernel staging
 scripts, watchdog and panic sysctl settings. Nothing under /boot is owned by
 this package.
